u y asígnale una identidad activa.","/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device",{"_44":67},{"_21":73,"_28":47,"_40":-7,"_23":74},"_1","Conceptos",{"_21":76,"_28":37,"_23":77,"_32":78,"_40":-7,"_13":79,"_42":80},"platform/pki/concepts/overview.mdx","Cómo funciona Lamassu","El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos.","/docs/platform/pki/concepts/overview",{"_44":76},{"_21":82,"_28":37,"_23":83,"_32":84,"_40":-7,"_13":85,"_42":86},"platform/pki/concepts/architecture.mdx","Arquitectura de la plataforma","Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos.","/docs/platform/pki/concepts/architecture",{"_44":82},{"_21":12,"_28":37,"_23":88,"_32":89,"_40":-7,"_13":14,"_42":90},"Ciclo de vida de una identidad","Estados, transiciones y decisiones operativas de un certificado de dispositivo.",{"_44":12},{"_21":92,"_28":47,"_40":-7,"_23":93},"_2","Operar Lamassu",{"_21":95,"_28":29,"_23":96,"_40":97,"_31":98,"_25":99},"operar-lamassu-kms","Claves y motores","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>",true,[100],{"_21":101,"_28":37,"_23":102,"_32":103,"_40":-7,"_13":104,"_42":105},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx-key-management","Visión general","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/platform/pki/key-management",{"_44":106},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_21":108,"_28":29,"_23":109,"_40":110,"_31":98,"_25":111},"operar-lamassu-ca","Autoridades y certificados","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2